WEBVTT

00:02:59.201 --> 00:03:01.201
because in the mind of those people,

00:03:01.225 --> 00:03:03.429
2020 will be yesterday.

00:03:06.596 --> 00:03:09.905
And I'm quite sure
that we want them to look at our time

00:03:09.929 --> 00:03:12.275
with pride and gratitude,

00:03:12.299 --> 00:03:13.987
because we knew what was happening

00:03:14.011 --> 00:03:16.486
and we know what needs to be done,

00:03:16.510 --> 00:03:20.039
and we actually, eventually,
did the right thing.

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:21.793
Thank you.